<title>BRAZIL: Brazil May 9 coffee regs 2.38 mln bags to July.</title>
<headline>Brazil May 9 coffee regs 2.38 mln bags to July.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil coffee export registrations as of May 9 totaled 2.38 million bags for May, June and July, according to the May 19 bulletin of the Rio de Janeiro Coffee Center.</p>
<p>A breakdown by month was as follows.</p>
<p> MONTH     REGISTRATIONS IN 60-KG BAGS</p>
<p> May		    1,502,332</p>
<p> June		     664,684</p>
<p> July		     216,595</p>
<p> TOTAL		  2,383,611</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
